e-27590.cms"/></item><item><title>Epstein Files: US House panel releases first batch; 33,000 investigation documents made public</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123666873.cms" /&gt;The US House of Representatives committee has released the initial set of documents related to the Jeffrey Epstein investigation. Over 33,000 pages were uploaded to the committee website. The Justice Department provided these records. Committee aims for full transparency. More records are expected, with redactions to protect victims. This follows criticism of the Trump administration regarding document release.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/epstein-files-us-house-panel-releases-first-batch-33000-investigation-documents-nade-public/articleshow/123666873.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/epstein-files-us-house-panel-releases-first-batch-33000-investigation-documents-nade-public/articleshow/123666873.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-03T05:16:05+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123666898,imgsize-34466.cms"/></item><item><title>Bahrain says local factories can now import raw materials duty-free to stay competitive</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123657924.cms" /&gt;Bahrain has introduced duty-free import rules for factories under Decision No. 63 of 2025, allowing exemptions on industrial inputs that are unavailable, below standards, delayed, or costlier locally. The move aims to reduce production costs, boost local manufacturing, and align with Bahrain’s Industrial Strategy 2022–2026 and Economic Vision 2030, strengthening self-sufficiency and enhancing global industrial competitiveness.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/bahrain-says-local-factories-can-now-import-raw-materials-duty-free-to-stay-competitive/articleshow/123657924.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/bahrain-says-local-factories-can-now-import-raw-materials-duty-free-to-stay-competitive/articleshow/123657924.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-03T03:06:55+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123664424,imgsize-1540449.cms"/></item><item><title>‘Two-tone hands’ and late arrival respark Trump health chatter as Oval Office gossip swirls</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123664393.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-dismisses-health-rumors-as-fake-news-but-two-tone-hands-and-late-arrival-re-spark-oval-office-gossip/articleshow/123664393.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/trump-dismisses-health-rumors-as-fake-news-but-two-tone-hands-and-late-arrival-re-spark-oval-office-gossip/articleshow/123664393.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-09-03T02:34:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123664394,imgsize-43772.cms"/></item><item><title>‘Bit scary’: Trump unsettled by viral AI video mapping his life, predicting 2025 return; quips, ‘Who did that?’</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123664368.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/bit-scary-trump-unsettled-by-viral-ai-video-mapping-his-life-predicting-2025-return-quips-who-did-that/a